id=ternak_tt
name=Ternak TT — Zygisk Fresh Persona
version=v1.2.2
versionCode=1202
author=Ilham311
description=Zygisk device spoofer targeting TikTok + Grab Passenger. 6-layer Java hook + 78 native prop spoofs + L7 TYPED spoof tables + companion fork+setns bind mount overlay. v1.2.0: ShadowHook + lsplant now consumed as prebuilt AAR from Maven Central (kills -Werror cascade on NDK r26d Clang). v1.2.1: Removed -fno-exceptions -fno-rtti so java_hooks.cpp's try/catch around std::stoll compiles. v1.2.2: Fixed build.sh crashing after all-ABI compile succeeded — copy_shadowhook_so still pointed at v1.1.9's add_subdirectory build tree; now reads from prebuilt/shadowhook/ and soft-skips x86/x86_64 (ByteDance ShadowHook AAR only ships arm64-v8a + armeabi-v7a; Path B is CMake-disabled for x86/x86_64 anyway). Works on Zygisk-Next / HMA-OSS, KernelSU + LSPosed, Android 12-16.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ilham311/Tt/main/update.json
